{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01O3:statement", "parent_tag": "01NS", "chapter": "constructions", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme and <MATH_0002> be a quasi-coherent sheaf\nof graded <MATH_0003>-algebras. Let <MATH_0004> be any morphism\nof schemes. Then there is a canonical isomorphism\n<MATH_0005>\nas well as a corresponding isomorphism\n<MATH_0006>\nof <MATH_0007>-graded\n<MATH_0008>-algebras.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_S$", "MATH_0004": "$g : S' \\to S$", "MATH_0005": "$$\nr :\n\\underline{\\text{Proj}}_{S'}(g^*\\mathcal{A})\n\\longrightarrow\nS' \\times_S \\underline{\\text{Proj}}_S(\\mathcal{A})\n$$", "MATH_0006": "$$\n\\theta :\nr^*\\text{pr}_2^*\\left(\\bigoplus\\nolimits_{d \\in \\mathbf{Z}}\n\\mathcal{O}_{\\underline{\\text{Proj}}_S(\\mathcal{A})}(d)\\right)\n\\longrightarrow\n\\bigoplus\\nolimits_{d \\in \\mathbf{Z}}\n\\mathcal{O}_{\\underline{\\text{Proj}}_{S'}(g^*\\mathcal{A})}(d)\n$$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathbf{Z}$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{O}_{\\underline{\\text{Proj}}_{S'}(g^*\\mathcal{A})}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-relative-proj-base-change}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:5a7e27060720b985d4592b8d3890cf3e1404f38c4a0c8c772a1d68c6914866f5", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f70ade41b715824dd90ebfcabba14cd713394f8df0ecd09c52242a3d10d82075", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4764afd1db98969ba88a86300e782bb67436cb32a7b9e9748354741e47d22354"}
