thcal{O}_{\\underline{\\text{Proj}}(\\mathcal{A})}(m) =\n\\mathcal{O}_{\\underline{\\text{Proj}}(\\mathcal{A})}(n + m)$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-apply-relative}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:d5e6b5db0b6765ddf6af85bb14ce468be62455ee354ca7298112cfef1a6cae51", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b870ac12f5417371921cf113cd48e51232b7112cc56d7e154cfc6f581e9ac440", "source_math_hash": "sha256:67252f22ff550fa2c9b068995386e8ebffc4526d48921449ce192a68e8d4088b"}
